{"term": {"label": "性", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 22, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "分", "id": "分"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "口", "id": "口"}, {"form": "味", "id": "味"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "弈", "id": "弈"}, {"form": "性", "variants": [], "id": "性"}, {"form": "戕賊", "id": "戕賊"}, {"form": "杞柳", "id": "杞柳"}, {"form": "桮棬", "id": "桮棬"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "甚", "id": "甚"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "白", "id": "白"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "耆", "id": "耆"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.23180161405732438, "source": "水", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.367295829986474, "source": "水", "target": "分"}, {"weight": 1.6625477377480486, "source": "水", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.7578579175523736, "source": "水", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.3523928094442093, "source": "水", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.367295829986474, "source": "水", "target": "勝"}, {"weight": 3.367295829986474, "source": "水", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 0.659245628884264, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.268683541318364, "source": "天下", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 0.4228568508200336, "source": "天下", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "天下", "target": "耆"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "天下", "target": "口"}, {"weight": 0.8823891801984737, "source": "天下", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 2.6459777724598323, "source": "欲", "target": "生"}, {"weight